#: title/pc5_ui.c:5859
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: VKD3D-Proton turns the game's Direct3D 12 into Vulkan. The "
"fastest, and what most games want."
msgstr ""
"PC5:s val: VKD3D-Proton gör om spelets Direct3D 12 till Vulkan. Snabbast, "
"och det de flesta spel vill ha."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5860
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: Wine's own Direct3D draws the game's DirectDraw with OpenGL."
msgstr "PC5:s val: Wines egen Direct3D ritar spelets DirectDraw med OpenGL."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5861
msgid ""
"PC5's choice: DXVK turns the game's Direct3D into Vulkan. The fastest, and "
"what most games want."
msgstr ""
"PC5:s val: DXVK gör om spelets Direct3D till Vulkan. Snabbast, och det de "
"flesta spel vill ha."

#: title/pc5_ui.c:5863
msgid ""
"Wine's own Direct3D 12 (VKD3D). Slower than Auto; try it if the game won't "
